PLC2801 [*] Unnecessary dunder call to `__str__`. Use `str()` builtin.
  --> bad_dunder_method_name_ctypes.py:51:12
   |
50 | def stringify(value):
51 |     return value.__str__()
   |            ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
help: Use `str()` builtin
   |
50 | def stringify(value):
   -     return value.__str__()
51 +     return str(value)
